    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Watch any web page for changes and get an AI summary of what changed\n\n### How it works\nInstead of re-reading a competitor page or a policy page yourself, this template watches it for you. On a schedule it fetches the page, strips it down to clean text, and compares it against the last snapshot stored in Google Sheets. On the very first run it just saves a baseline. When the text later changes, a Basic LLM Chain with Google Gemini reads the old and new versions and explains in two or three sentences what actually changed - a new price, a new feature, removed wording - rather than dumping the whole page, and calls out trivial edits as no meaningful change. Real changes are posted to Slack and the snapshot is updated so each change is reported once. Fetch failures are reported and retried next run.\n\n",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 568
      },
      "id": "64acf4e8-f0e2-41f7-a1ba-d25963b1293e",
      "name": "Overview Sticky",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1920,
        1072
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Fetch & clean\nRun on a schedule, fetch the page and strip it to clean text. Fetch failures go to Slack.",
        "height": 664,
        "width": 860,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "2efdc566-9557-455c-b34d-3bda2cea469c",
      "name": "S1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1328,
        1008
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Compare to last snapshot\nRead the previous snapshot from Sheets and diff it. First run saves a baseline silently.",
        "height": 664,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "3356220a-d511-45e0-b590-644c64d6d84a",
      "name": "S2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -448,
        1008
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Summarise & notify (Basic LLM Chain)\nOn a real change, Gemini explains what changed, Slack is notified, and the snapshot is updated so each change is reported once.",
        "height": 676,
        "width": 948,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "fd113325-03ff-4eaf-8796-74d829472d15",
      "name": "S3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        192,
